  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "800301",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Dainsleif",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80030101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80030101": {
            "id": "80030101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Dain, there you are. Did you see Master Jean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030102"
            ]
          },
          "80030102": {
            "id": "80030102",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "I saw her, but purposely avoided her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030103"
            ]
          },
          "80030103": {
            "id": "80030103",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "As both the Lionfang Knight and Acting Grand Master, she naturally would have some reservations towards me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030104"
            ]
          },
          "80030104": {
            "id": "80030104",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "If I'm not careful, one day I may find myself becoming the object of one of her investigations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030105"
            ]
          },
          "80030105": {
            "id": "80030105",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "But back to the matter at hand... I defeated some of the Abyss forces but wasn't able to gather any information. Did you have more success?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030106"
            ]
          },
          "80030106": {
            "id": "80030106",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "I see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030107"
            ]
          },
          "80030107": {
            "id": "80030107",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Well then. We can more or less figure out where the first Field Tiller ended up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030108"
            ]
          },
          "80030108": {
            "id": "80030108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Really? Just from the Lupus Boreas story?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030109"
            ]
          },
          "80030109": {
            "id": "80030109",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "That information combined with a more comprehensive analysis.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030110"
            ]
          },
          "80030110": {
            "id": "80030110",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "For example, the old story you told me you heard in the Cathedral...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030111"
            ]
          },
          "80030111": {
            "id": "80030111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"The Tyrant's Final Fury\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030112"
            ]
          },
          "80030112": {
            "id": "80030112",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Exactly, the strange story told to you by that young sister, long mistaken to be a curse rained down by a deceased tyrant.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030115"
            ]
          },
          "80030115": {
            "id": "80030115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, Paimon gets it! So \"The Tyrant's Final Fury\" was really just missiles fired from the Field Tiller after it ran from Wolvendom!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030116"
            ]
          },
          "80030116": {
            "id": "80030116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "After it was damaged in the fight with the Wolf of the North, it must have wandered into the ruins of Old Mondstadt and stayed there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030117"
            ]
          },
          "80030117": {
            "id": "80030117",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then, whenever anyone got close — PEW, PEW, BOOM! It would fire a ton of missiles at them... Until one day, it finally broke down for good, and the fireballs stopped raining from the sky.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030118"
            ]
          },
          "80030118": {
            "id": "80030118",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Back then, the people of Mondstadt hadn't seen many Ruin Guards before, so they came to interpret it as \"The Tyrant's Final Fury\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030119"
            ]
          },
          "80030119": {
            "id": "80030119",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "It looks like we need to make a trip to <color=#00E1FFFF>Stormterror's Lair</color> and comb the entire area."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800306",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Stormterror's Lair",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80030601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80030601": {
            "id": "80030601",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They... left...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030602"
            ]
          },
          "80030602": {
            "id": "80030602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Oh, don't be too sad, {NICKNAME}... We'll find them again! Look on the bright side, at least we got some really useful information!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030604",
              "80030606"
            ]
          },
          "80030604": {
            "id": "80030604",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really? You sure...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030607"
            ]
          },
          "80030607": {
            "id": "80030607",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "At least now, as well as The Seven, Dain is also a key part of finding your sibling too, right?"
          },
          "80030606": {
            "id": "80030606",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh-huh, that's right!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800307",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Dainsleif",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80030301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80030301": {
            "id": "80030301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is it, right? Okay then, use your Elemental Sight to look for the eye!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030302"
            ]
          },
          "80030302": {
            "id": "80030302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooooh... So what did you see?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030303"
            ]
          },
          "80030303": {
            "id": "80030303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? ...Nothing? But Paimon was so excited...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030304"
            ]
          },
          "80030304": {
            "id": "80030304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's going on...? Are you sure you did it right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030305"
            ]
          },
          "80030305": {
            "id": "80030305",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "This requires another method.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030306"
            ]
          },
          "80030306": {
            "id": "80030306",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Using Elemental Sight on a Field Tiller is of no use because it is not powered by the elements.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030307"
            ]
          },
          "80030307": {
            "id": "80030307",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Let me give it a try.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030308"
            ]
          },
          "80030308": {
            "id": "80030308",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "...And done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030309"
            ]
          },
          "80030309": {
            "id": "80030309",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wowwww! It's, it's the...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030310"
            ]
          },
          "80030310": {
            "id": "80030310",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "The very thing the Abyss Herald has been seeking all along — the eye of the first Field Tiller.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030311"
            ]
          },
          "80030311": {
            "id": "80030311",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "All of the Ruin Guards today are just replicas of this machine. As the prototype, its combat capability was unrestricted.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030312"
            ]
          },
          "80030312": {
            "id": "80030312",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Prototype\"? ...Paimon doesn't know that word, is it another ancient term from Khaenri'ah?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030313"
            ]
          },
          "80030313": {
            "id": "80030313",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "As the Abyss Order has surmised, if this eye is placed in the hands of the Defiled Statue...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030314"
            ]
          },
          "80030314": {
            "id": "80030314",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "And if the limbs of Osial, Overlord of the Vortex, are attached to the statue... there you have a mechanized god.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030315"
            ]
          },
          "80030315": {
            "id": "80030315",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "And this newly born god will have the power to \"topple the divine thrones of Celestia.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030318"
            ]
          },
          "80030318": {
            "id": "80030318",
            "speakerId": 1022,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Yes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030319"
            ]
          },
          "80030319": {
            "id": "80030319",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Th—Then... What should we do with this eye?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800302",
      "subQuestName": "Enter the ruins again",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80030201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80030201": {
            "id": "80030201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, c—could that be...!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030202"
            ]
          },
          "80030202": {
            "id": "80030202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#{F#Aether}{M#Lumine}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030203"
            ]
          },
          "80030203": {
            "id": "80030203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sibling",
            "text": "#{F#Lumine}{M#Aether}...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030206"
            ]
          },
          "80030206": {
            "id": "80030206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#W—Wait, {NICKNAME}... {F#He}{M#She} just blocked an attack against the Abyss Herald...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030207"
            ]
          },
          "80030207": {
            "id": "80030207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Your {F#brother}{M#sister}, and the Abyss...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030208"
            ]
          },
          "80030208": {
            "id": "80030208",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sibling",
            "text": "#{F#Lumine}{M#Aether}, why are you with Dain?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800308",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80030401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80030401": {
            "id": "80030401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, after all that running around, we end up right back here again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030402"
            ]
          },
          "80030402": {
            "id": "80030402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look at us... We barely escaped this place last time, and now we're strolling right back in!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80030403"
            ]
          },
          "80030403": {
            "id": "80030403",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gee, surely we must be some of the bravest adventurers in all of Teyvat! That or the stupidest..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800309",
